{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1457,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c710e7aefa56aa52643fe979",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要穿上这件决胜服，即便在赛场上\r\n也能很容易认出小真了吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "bccb33a48d0782ac8e28d9360399dff59e3ad079c8faec7980e20dbc040f1f80",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "71009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:064a0018fcba1ea5362fa8bb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我每天早上都会烫缎带。\r\n毕竟无法确定什么时候会是我\r\n最后一次拍照嘛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9647f58d339baa986140f45c2891128d248a0335d0278d5fd7e722065f5706b4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "71010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba7be9e6f424f926034ef99a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "演唱会就是一场考验，\r\n考验着唱歌跳舞的功力和口才。",
      "source_fingerprint": "036b9f7e86c27a32c0bc5db304ce10ae4a3965e0512452ac5c3b0b1f0e56d19b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "71014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:24ade353fb6f0906b7900e98",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是参考我的形象，\r\n只属于我的服装……呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b6e44a0e8da7ccb0af862bd0f80ec07a5867f27e08ad0af0196ef1188e0ba61",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "71015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2caffe82d7343114f6a69c00",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要来摸一下这件衣服吗？\r\n会让你很难忘的哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "6eac4a50dc501e076bc5c7e58df7263c429574e1fb9d9b4ba9835facea16146a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "71016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d0f88cbd0993421c426fe9d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵，其实头冠也是特制的哦。\r\n你看你看。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a6dfc8e865d2b46501b7baee79eb3ac75f3aec1dd475c1deef8f22102b9cd6a4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "71017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:91e2650f0775ac21197a21d9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小真的换衣时间～",
      "source_fingerprint": "411fd1b233c3acf73977c43b13316a1a6bb89a474a4afb9e0aa359374313ba80",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "71018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:526737fb57ffad6784090bce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次就用这套服装出周边吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cfc016df16c8e567f0300e27660a8296319ad55d1bc6adf3718d35fc232a3608",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f6fdc11b8b224763ca58b130",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f747fdfd41fdd19d5e6205e2563472ecb3e45190ea9201c283e895272ee13e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c4df2ad118acbcd31fc826ce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要对决啊，我知道了。\r\n请好好见证小真的奔跑哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c423c8dcbc0b1614931403788a0d17201247bdeeb8e125fc55fd8fd786a5199d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "81000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea74bcd37b495df66e65c98b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这份实力，毋庸置疑。\r\n那么，作为马娘界的吉祥物，\r\n小真也不会输的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d84b05b3b3b710a4be48457ae86f4c1fd58283e352f0d7e4882c6c0f4a1c0312",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "81001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad9662dffd99b3d2f3021f75",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早安。一大早的小真也很可爱喔。\r\n请尽情欣赏吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "294a76ad8a6b59c429ae955b64394f93cebccae022ba9c20aa65655fb435afb8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4edc2c1e14f7383b8ac2b151",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早上的阳光照起来好舒服。\r\n让人意识到自己今天也有好好起床，\r\n觉得非常幸福呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b09c5d8c5fd7cd5e9167da65f899c6cf00f9ad32b17b18c786b8b9bf86f84934",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e9e842d8cae26aef166c06a3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哈啰，训练员。\r\n世界级小真就在这里喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "be4fe60534e72737c2237c1d5f886342b653eb57d17e1351371d52eb7b21ffdf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:60f7874282942dbb73859fa6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "已经到午餐时间了吗？\r\n请坐这里吧。大家都说小真的\r\n旁边特别能让人放松呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e38731d37d181a2e728ae6281063a2f9fdfb6d56c870691652afe2a99dcb906e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:806b68186c76002df1db07c8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀，训练员。呵呵呵。\r\n小真是不是闻起来很香啊？\r\n其实我今天已经洗好澡了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f397f004a77f56d81d5c4c32036590a43a9014e26658d08355888f788fa43d5e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df9b3b3e359dc9a15181c722",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天就快结束了。\r\n呵呵，但还没结束，对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ecf5adbaae1e3070a119843615ff678f1a84cf607dc6b969ccbeb559bf73cb1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2787741a3e8577461dda0f0f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼，天气变得好暖和喔。\r\n你明天想跟我一起去\r\n晒晒太阳还是散步呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ccc2647d536797af9f636775a0cbda9a9fd62ff9ee7e801e79a67ec2f8cdf632",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:84d0d9481e83c6fb188f7c9a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唉……我现在好想变成麦茶喔。\r\n……请在小真的周围，\r\n放一堆飘浮的冰块吧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a84cac5ed9e06cce7fff5a99b0e305b0d11031ebbcf4bd7183bd6ef01f714cf6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c94e9b270a5188314674d4a2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "跑外围时看到的柿子树，\r\n又有一棵变成了小真的颜色。\r\n你什么时候才会染上小真的颜色呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a86151b0cbedb95780a3841a9b27c3f04ef789c0f28208736136d86afba9f9b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:90fd35eeffee63ec1e57f9ba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不能再多下一点雪吗？\r\n这是制作等身小真雪雕的\r\n好机会……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "729e903c8103c04975bedb92cac37c8b425aa2ce726f5ab7381fca08aad7cfc9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:19a30f8c7856158e08d9de1d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "‌小真的晨间时光。哼哼，有没有\r\n闻到一股甜甜的香气呢？这是\r\n用古龙香水加深印象的作战计划哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "faa473b335c89c7fd8b001388260f73c98698f4af6557cc2817fa62f2e5b451f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "90010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:945d03f7a0abdcdb3018edc3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵、呵、呵，真幸运呢。\r\n早上就开始见面的话，\r\n和小真一起的回忆就会更多呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3af1355a9d63e58e63cef0aedbd5d3bb0dcb633a8a6970669f96b0bd788a06ed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "90011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2c5abeeb7640d7582cc9375c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "据说有的圈子流行着\r\n从各种马娘照片中找出小真的游戏。\r\n今天午餐时的挑战难度超高哦～‌",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ea72a5862f81da1abcf23e40a9945e03a2405703a1f54b1dd49d5117d7dc2d2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "90012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7bfdc04ac919d76d5952b2e5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "听说今天有杂志社要来采访呢‌。\r\n虽然不像夜讨朝驱那样突然‌，\r\n但这可是突击营业的大好机会！",
      "source_fingerprint": "70d3e3b207497e29e08aef2d793201d67455e27a68df508e33f3726a19dc3276",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "90013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:32112f750605c75ec3a8d700",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然晚上想好好休息一下~\r\n但我想到了新周边的企划，\r\n得趁还没忘记之前整理一下。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3bb2fb94aac355a53216d4e609c3efb539a6e52a0e7a2ffe7209686fe772b62b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "90014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d08d436527c35b5d4f90b0b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "困了就用棉花糖可可补充糖分。\r\n很有效果很值得推荐。\r\n不过，要适可而止哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e3bb25b0cc46b93fa7e7cc60f1e4515b6a8a03e23be09497ddb2cd108388822e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "90015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c58c681f19e4b05ad98e50ce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "蒲公英会乘风旅行。\r\n每个城镇的人们都会记得蒲公英。\r\n……我得好好向它学习。",
      "source_fingerprint": "73d5af65c2f4f6e8437315f19f34293c5662e3ef7d0b0ceb945a7bdb363861ee",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "90016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ea532f65e841cfffc8cc860",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "正拍着刨冰的照片，\r\n眼看着就在强烈的日照下融化了……\r\n那么美味的刨冰……让人有点落寞呢。‌",
      "source_fingerprint": "c2a1f14e06676a6d1ff63344b105cf7be507d24abf60e1de98fd987243fb3f22",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "90017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d532de3244831ad4f45e3e3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们去寻找小小的秋天吧。\r\n去创造数不清的回忆，\r\n填满心中的相册。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5247647f1a07f456bbaacaad2d4454e9d216a18334b8c1ec33f7cb0f777f17cd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "90018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3663ea7d7ea41dcc2da4ca90",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在快要下雪的日子里，\r\n我会伸出手仰望天空。\r\n希望自己不会忘记这形状和温度。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ebfca8678ea9bf1b719ce03df822df65fbd1320563c33b38a5526f9a41a5fc8a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "90019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b105b37565cadbb2be123edc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f3455df99fcdf52dccf9e7b073c56d68f8d34a6868121f5a62cfc4738b1b633",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf56a5d13b37f6cd99301c23",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f3455df99fcdf52dccf9e7b073c56d68f8d34a6868121f5a62cfc4738b1b633",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "90021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7bac8b54e4748e9d9b352415",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论是伏特加，\r\n还是赤骥，\r\n小真都会跑在她们前面。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e2c7d7a477e271cb92f4d55cf77d414721f86c2869848822b5bb099c1785bd54",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:24534fe0f1bbb18554149f82",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真机伶真的是无懈可击。\r\n我只要想去入镜就会被发现，\r\n她还愿意跟我合影呢。耶嘿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "286e2c811928932fe1f2e8a1c09e973c5ef52b3c19e8a5a98d1e2a84acd373a6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a53eb9a4ab438d601ab9b687",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小真的爸爸很会开车。\r\n所以小真将来一定也很快就能\r\n考到驾照，很厉害吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "759c07e4f0a3ebbf17c50f2e8e62e540d45e8c0323c656470b38aa0f69b89855",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c62eda5df0ec0152c3e170fb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔！这是涡轮师父的脚步声。\r\n听起来……似乎正在被某人追赶！\r\n嗯，还真是备受疼爱呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff490e582ca1d3d6e6cd048e310b9d46b80f13b64ed675fecf95ea9c51293b66",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:063865b553dc99672d4aae3a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我不太喜欢太纯粹的白色。\r\n感觉跟消毒水的味道很像。",
      "source_fingerprint": "695dc759b1e3da248c99cf4498bf30755826a0a2be2eaabea2bf94033852069c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea46bee4a0b6ca1ecd818e6f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "运动神经好不代表\r\n舞一定也跳得很好。\r\n话先说在前头……这是两回事。",
      "source_fingerprint": "93c2cccbdc8d489936164575aca860c9df484d4c223105bffa024e3b0c37e74c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f5644dfc55bf368769410c4e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小真穿短裤也很好看呢。\r\n呵呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd81c2499161b14781cf7bffa5b4f3d87e9d33c4c0fa3f08763f662793727d2d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ae762a497bed09b21f02fd1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要变得比所有人都快，想必\r\n就连重要的比赛也能够跑赢──\r\n只要各方面都快得无人能及的话……",
      "source_fingerprint": "636651622b1638218bd930966d590b1417b22e56baf59662b6e2424d985ccf19",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0c4421c52e2a7294d7072a6c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小真未来会成为超究极吉祥物，\r\n所以会变得很伟大。\r\n因为会变伟大，所以我才戴着王冠。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d4a00ea5324ee80941f9ef33ba59a410ebe1eda3e60d24afd74cc72e53bfcdf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e4fa538028bbaa4063696863",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想要一直当迷人小真，就要持续\r\n努力……呼……早上在洗脸台总是\r\n免不了一场激战……呼啊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "5809d5d0a158ad87cc3b9442e4e8254e9ec337975101cbe3d17ee7fc2e84b4be",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7053e601eb4092d4e01ad6aa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下午茶的时间还没到吗？\r\n……（紧盯──）",
      "source_fingerprint": "0650b061156257f6eb5b66328c3503a2ce9c085745be98c1c107055bbfce57ca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f6743179dd437e60a127846c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "家里那个调皮的妹妹差不多要\r\n联络我了。今晚要怎么回复她呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9c0c08fb62bff1abd23b62c2ec6177118e91e9948339b8f2e07a852d38aa336",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b02e9013ae96cb3edae7c54f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论是在学园或赛场，\r\n都有越来越多新的赛马娘。\r\n小真也必须加油才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d842197e6a095e920436a0cbd17b0c5f47f29ef569e492063256574e8119be26",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:31fa1a8efbdd04d77efd35eb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我擦了太多防晒油，\r\n有点黏答答的。\r\n要变得跟我一样吗？来，别客气。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9984e4f105061e213f0ed481a8eaa87976cc9c3fa4dbf2095bf826f04af0556",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc4b9e7a1bc3bad5ff323033",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "年底的销售大战就快到了。\r\n开发商品、制作周边、上架作业，\r\n必须趁现在全力以赴。",
      "source_fingerprint": "592e4e6b8da58effde912b693a45625db641cc4d89a5e4b3e55418e5dae7cac5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c75cbe012a339f2f3945dae6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "外面的花枯萎了。\r\n……等到了春天会再开花吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e0f7420d7d897d5d2bfe79fdcdd01ec1bb245c7b9b82f83e6abf92e93d1f0d36",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb2b278ebe1cebfeb80a7c7c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "妈妈做的曲奇味道很柔和。\r\n能够成为永不褪色回忆……\r\n我也想烤出这样的曲奇。",
      "source_fingerprint": "048664bedb0cc63c3940827aa472515c1ac163f9472bd422d5658c6d06eaa2c4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b9c57dbd97aacfe298402ed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "飞翔学姐的穿搭风格既有趣又实用，\r\n相关照片还引起了热议。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e61d63ab3a5f7f9fee166b5604870d3c9164ebafdf54666a25458c9afa8f11d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2e5907d6dbfb9e58539011db",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小花同学送的花，\r\n我试着拿去做了压花书签。\r\n书的回忆和气味交织在了一起。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e59916f54b34ee7cbfbcd8bbe33e95bcd1dec5597fae7a7579ea9af651eac76",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:28f1f7234cdbbf649754fd67",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "正在使用上传到Umasta的照片\r\n制作周边，成品是能与充满季节感的\r\n小真共同出镜的主题日历‌。",
      "source_fingerprint": "618324b7f09e21b93cda15d156a732c406af0037a4913a845f0b84695003586a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f75d30a8eabda48be550a007",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "二人对半分享一份点心相视而笑……\r\n我想要像这样甜蜜、温柔\r\n又难以替代的回忆。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d3c0f7114d55576c50660e1c05aba8027b4d0b5ce84a1634ed86f65ee640a4ed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e3328029298317f5c39b708d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "被爱的小真之路也需始于足下。\r\n每天都要早起好好打理发型和仪容。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d8d30c7c860e6f1f53f8dee68854d9d56938bf10b6063d016a89332ef117010b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:135bdb679327f9c53aeac8ff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "衣服上的点心灵感来源于\r\n小真甜点组合。这样的话\r\n就能有很好的宣传预期了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "92b5af47332c33672d161d19c9eab79fcdc37aef3d5c5eb0cbd6ad28dc3027e5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6efcc62adc7c70bbe87b440e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一条尾巴轻轻翘♪两只耳朵摇啊摇♪\r\n感觉怎么样呢？小真的数数歌\r\n保证让你安然入睡。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a61f29151a9dd1777eaee9159395320da2c7fd0617b757816eff3d0440ca220d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27732a1904eed74e32b040a6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "外面暖洋洋的，\r\n洗过的玩偶散发着太阳的味道。\r\n或许也该清洗一下玩偶服……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "212557c300cdbd10bab1ed188c69f989f5f6128cc3a57a04472e8693417d433d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:465255d28cbc98b12b9c27f4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "红豆冰淇淋永远不会融化。\r\n永恒是存在的。对此表示敬佩。\r\n只是，‌这样我就很难把它吃掉了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b39d6b6138586058b08666f66dba8f9788efd670c11f8df7296e428141866705",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f205b096dbf6b23d4d5c4159",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "天气变凉了，到了可以穿上\r\n各种衣服的季节。一起去\r\n色彩缤纷的街道上拍人像照吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "179edec219d5ebb03a75bae250bf4fce024d4b389b6d7af6f820cdb882359099",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e0a25f043ad5c10ac5fb1d54",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "宿舍里出现了被炉。\r\n大家自然地聚在一起很热闹。\r\n仅仅只是欢笑，就让人暖暖的",
      "source_fingerprint": "11d1ce822a236c51cd5f5a06738556319c388a89ab339ecc51736ad46b172a37",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:20640f042395ef62daf5ac07",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "外观和穿着都很满意。\r\n要拍张照片吗？软萌Q弹小真，\r\n现在拍的话就是独家发布会了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a9317dbd49b78415b07947f598b8261dc47023ad5baffdcff7535c0abcbb1eae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a2a8834f646c9da264bffa8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "兔子化妆包很可爱♪\r\n我要把它活用到今后的\r\n小真玩偶周边造型中。",
      "source_fingerprint": "48736c83d1a6f542d93a28d75f00a538e74a9c4be4635df98b0dc766fd152253",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f6f9b9118e6bcc90e1a9854",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我已经在长椅上摆满了小真娃娃。\r\n如果在训练时有客人上门，\r\n就麻烦你处理了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "505a6104bab98cbb2ccaad260002686f48f80f11a1ee852222ed482562cc14d8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27439189abff6f230cef7fbf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会努力的",
      "source_fingerprint": "125f28c5f90e711e1dc5503495b7a0c08e73b58143e3c372492d0cf84c50f21b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e38fc1ab0c825be328e119e5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "脚的节奏是哒哒哒……嗯。\r\n……要再更快！哒哒哒哒！\r\n嗯，就照这个节奏吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1eecc5c22e8f6144d78076f9ad0dd9dac26195afcf03e805f405b162615967d2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5f2375855d4fbe4de0119e11",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我想要变得能跑出一场\r\n足以上新闻头条的精彩比赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5153f7eed31b9049ee8606b012268b0b0cad15f9ef2fc3ac79593910e64a98c3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c9e44de6eb632bf46d89b25",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "加油喔，嘿。加油喔！\r\n……这首歌叫「加油喔」之歌。\r\n我明年一定会让它热销百万张。",
      "source_fingerprint": "73f3d72667b74303daa35626303923801642b83c2a181a483abd3de8f30211b1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:614aaf61bf5861cb9f225c75",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一起打造出无敌的身体吧。\r\n要打造出强韧又帅气并受人崇拜，\r\n专属于小真的身体。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f03297220dac27f22a0119e5911d1bcf85834567dd5f41bc6b9481b69c69ca84",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe5e4a8c290327e4b5890802",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你期待我能有更好的表现吗？\r\n你觉得我能朝更高的目标迈进吗？\r\n放心吧，小真一定办得到。",
      "source_fingerprint": "95d4c191eeb1fc05a703ae9ea8addbd2496e44caa856b81e6a5d936e3fd5e597",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c4a7605be13761f3243cb0c8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论是多艰难的训练都不要紧。\r\n因为无法实现目标，\r\n才是最令人难受的事情。",
      "source_fingerprint": "74d9bc4b162c4ea47cf0b17e30fe3b938f3aa31888c3e783157474c9fcc83909",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:305cd318f9bcc8d298f8935f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "盛夏的太阳也在为我加油。\r\n小真会变得比任何人都闪耀。",
      "source_fingerprint": "869fd05c02a0b52dcd428a4b59185d6dc86bc7a3e2a7a4a2121ffe377ff40d65",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:053a18a34cf95f1b904ac4f2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "软萌Q弹的小真也得好好训练。\r\n飒爽Q弹，加油到底。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d3bb60c24e428f00130460a9c317ab547a455579a1c73028d47435b96f37d9da",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb616882154b97eadea6067f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好了，发型也很完美。\r\n作为被爱着的小真，\r\n训练时也不能疏忽大意。",
      "source_fingerprint": "54529b716efb43002350e015779af137028b80885c875f1cb041149a9d82136f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:48692b9de6444a5a75fbe900",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "以前考虑过的『要加油喽』之歌，\r\n正在设计舞蹈混音。\r\n我打算在准备体操中推广使用。",
      "source_fingerprint": "89b4958701d642d245cc65be324ee59caeb31559cf322f058ab6587347c17e59",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8dabf493242de2fc62aa922",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "观众们每次按下『马赞』，\r\n耳机里就会发出声音。\r\n小真之力增加了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2a5f2128ec9f648213583247f2140f3a5fab7e2f1dd182eeb2c6f46ece794f4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b9dd65b721791bbf686aff1e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呣呣，能感觉到远处的视线。\r\n这是……记者的气息。\r\n看来是关注度上升了吧……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "561bd5665f220e1f2f75745c6963738008ae64c4cba1f3a0b15b09d8ecff5f11",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b88102815286e8bb6e1f2ae6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天胜过昨天，明天胜过今天。\r\n要把这些都刻在眼中哦。\r\n小真每天都会像这样焕新自我。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ba88a0a1028332f7a724486c6ebc0ed5be86d5c771639028f478e9a3aca2cc4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fba60728eb75566dcf0fd1e2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们的日常，\r\n正在这片天空下不断延续着。\r\n‌无论何时，无论何地。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ed445edc2ceb398ccad7e30f72fed33f51ea0fcf002cdc236d57893263ed8d6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd27017ffbee5148b4337cdb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你要永远永远记得我喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "80d59531948320abd3e1acc16eb18fb9ee18e8b59d1060c4a165af456159070e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "93000"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
